probe_h2o_rks_631gs: H2O RKS/B3LYP/6-31G* with Cartesian d (Gaussian's default
6D for this basis), 1 frozen core, active MOs 2-12. The second MOKIT gate: SP
shells and Cartesian d differ from PySCF in order and in per-function
normalization, and a KS job always needs the rebuilt Fock matrices.
